1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 18=

10
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,790
Prince Jing broke into the inner palace.

11
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,470
Punish him with twenty lashes.

12
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,110
In this life,

13
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:06,760
I, Xiao Yunting,
will never hurt you again.

14
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,590
I'll give you my whole heart

15
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,200
and ask for nothing in return.

16
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,560
I brought you some wound medicine.

17
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:32,150
I'll leave it here.

18
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:36,000
Xiang Rong said you like camellias,

19
00:01:36,230 --> 00:01:38,000
so I picked some on the way.

20
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,560
If you don't like them,
I'll throw them away.

21
00:01:44,010 --> 00:01:44,790
I like them.

22
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,350
What did you say?

23
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,070
I...

24
00:01:52,870 --> 00:01:53,640
I said...

25
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:57,870
I said

26
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:00,790
I like them.

27
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:10,590
How's

28
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,710
your injury?

29
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,430
It's just flesh wounds.

30
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:27,150
Nothing serious.

31
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,990
Breaking into the inner palace
is a capital offense.

32
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,030
Weren't you afraid?

33
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:33,870
I was.

34
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,470
I was worried

35
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:40,680
I could only save you

36
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,750
once.

37
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:55,680
You can't go in.

38
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,840
Out.

39
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:08,190
Please leave.

40
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:10,910
I said you get out.

41
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,150
Me?

42
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:15,630
Get out.

43
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:25,980
(Healing Ointment)

44
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,240
How are you?

45
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,590
Where do you plan to go now?

46
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:33,750
None of your business.

47
00:03:34,470 --> 00:03:35,710
Prince Cheng's body

48
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:37,520
was hung in the prince's residence
by Liujin.

49
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:39,680
It was made to look like
he died for love.

50
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,870
The servants have also been dismissed.

51
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:45,430
I'm sure you don't want
to go back to Prince Qi either.

52
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:47,000
As for the Qi family...

53
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:48,870
I have nowhere to go.

54
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:51,180
You sound very pleased with yourself.

55
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:55,590
At the very least,
I'm the top noble lady in the capital.

56
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:58,310
I have looks and talent.

57
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,310
Finding a place to stay

58
00:04:02,910 --> 00:04:04,030
is hardly difficult.

59
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:07,030
If you hand your fate to someone else,

60
00:04:07,030 --> 00:04:08,590
you'll always be at their mercy.

61
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:10,280
You should put your own fate

62
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:12,150
back in your hands.

63
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,310
What are you gloating about?

64
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:15,870
Without the Qi family,

65
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,310
you would be nothing but a butcher.

66
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,390
Who are you calling a butcher?

67
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,000
I admit I spoke out of turn,

68
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:26,070
but you're no better.

69
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:38,750
If life is as fragile as duckweed,

70
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,190
it'll be tossed from place to place.

71
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,560
Such a life can't be easy.

72
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,120
Your hands

73
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,190
are well suited for the guqin.

74
00:04:55,210 --> 00:04:57,160
There are a few girls
from Yueying Pleasure House

75
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:58,560
who had nowhere else to go.

76
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,160
I have settled them here.

77
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:02,000
I wonder if you would be willing

78
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:04,000
to teach them how to play the guqin

79
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,390
and earn some money.

80
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:07,680
You think a few scraps of silver

81
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,560
will make me bow and scrape to you?

82
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,160
In your dreams.

83
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,560
Have you no end to this?

84
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:15,270
No need to refuse so quickly.

85
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,870
Take your time.

86
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:30,820
(Prince Qi Residence)

87
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:37,920
Mother,

88
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,120
what brings you here?

89
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:43,120
If I didn't come now,

90
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,870
the Liu family

91
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:47,120
would likely have been uprooted.

92
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,160
What?

93
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,480
Qi Yuan went to Siliu Pavilion.

94
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:52,680
Have you ever wondered

95
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,360
why she went there?

96
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,040
The score has gone missing.

97
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,000
They must've found traces

98
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,680
of my sister.

99
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:03,120
Score?

100
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,680
What score?

101
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:08,360
Qi Yuan was summoned into the palace
by you, wasn't she?

102
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:09,920
I was about to ask you that.

103
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,800
Why are you asking me?

104
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,240
Is that not because

105
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,920
of all your foolish nonsense?

106
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,040
For that woman,

107
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,680
you have been punished by His Majesty
again and again

108
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,480
and made me lose all face.

109
00:06:22,270 --> 00:06:23,240
And now,

110
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:26,160
she even took my score.

111
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,830
If they use that score

112
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:29,040
to find my sister,

113
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,000
and His Majesty learns
what happened back then,

114
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,800
the Liu family will be finished for good.

115
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,720
Calm down, Mother.

116
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,270
Please allow me to look into
the score matter.

117
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,070
Still,

118
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,920
even if Qi Yuan finds Aunt,

119
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,950
everyone in the capital listens to us.

120
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:43,120
They may not...

121
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:43,920
You look into it?

122
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,870
You've lost your mind

123
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:49,430
over that woman.

124
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,950
You spare her every time,

125
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:53,120
yet every time,

126
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,480
she targets the Liu family at its core.

127
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,750
Ling,

128
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,120
she has to die.

129
00:06:59,270 --> 00:06:59,920
Ling,

130
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,630
kill her now.

131
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,240
Mother.

132
00:07:23,430 --> 00:07:24,480
I...

133
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,560
I like Qi Yuan.

134
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:35,120
Do you think
the Liu family can't do without you?

135
00:07:35,700 --> 00:07:36,680
There are plenty of children

136
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,680
in the palace

137
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,160
born to mothers of lowly status.

138
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:42,000
I can simply adopt one

139
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,240
to carry on the Liu family's bloodline.

140
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,560
They're more obedient than you.

141
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,430
More sensible than you.

142
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:47,600
More useful than you.

143
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:53,120
Qi Yuan must die.

144
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,360
The Qi family

145
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:57,120
must die as well.

146
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:02,600
I'm giving you one last chance.

147
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,480
Otherwise,

148
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,920
don't blame me for showing you no mercy.

149
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,240
Lianqiao,

150
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,870
what's it?

151
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:25,000
Why are you covering my eye?

152
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,190
It's what you like.

153
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,150
The finest camellias
in the entire capital

154
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,390
are all here.

155
00:09:10,910 --> 00:09:12,120
I believe

156
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:15,000
you'll become the first titled woman

157
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,120
in our dynasty.

158
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:17,750
You should have

159
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:19,480
a residence

160
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,670
of your own.

161
00:09:21,750 --> 00:09:22,960
I remember you once said

162
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,320
you needed a place

163
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,990
where you wouldn't have
to depend on anyone,

164
00:09:28,350 --> 00:09:29,910
where you wouldn't have to stay on guard

165
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:32,200
all the time.

166
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,790
Though this place can't compare
to the Qi Residence,

167
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,510
every brick, every tile,

168
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:39,080
every blade of grass, every tree

169
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,910
belongs to you.

170
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:43,440
Here,

171
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,870
you can lower all your guard

172
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,440
and be yourself.

173
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:49,120
No one can make you leave,

174
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,960
and no rules can bind you.

175
00:09:52,910 --> 00:09:54,440
These camellias in the courtyard

176
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,750
bloom only for you.

177
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,390
And not just the flowers,

178
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:01,000
the mornings, evenings,
and every season here

179
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:03,270
all belong to you.

180
00:10:09,550 --> 00:10:11,030
The east wing can be used as a study.

181
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:13,080
I had the windows made larger

182
00:10:14,090 --> 00:10:15,870
so you can smell the flowers
while you read.

183
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:18,900
And the west room,

184
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:20,480
it's sitting empty anyway.

185
00:10:20,610 --> 00:10:22,390
You can keep
whatever collection you like there.

186
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,220
And most importantly,

187
00:10:24,550 --> 00:10:26,750
there's this empty space
in the back garden.

188
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:28,200
If you want to butcher pigs,

189
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,150
we can...

190
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:32,200
If you don't like that,

191
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,270
we won't butcher pigs.

192
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,550
Xiao Yunting,

193
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,550
which one

194
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,030
is the real you?

195
00:10:52,980 --> 00:10:57,620
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

196
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:01,780
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

197
00:11:02,290 --> 00:11:07,750
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

198
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:12,130
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

199
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:17,200
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

200
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:24,900
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
